<span class="cs-line cmt"># that violate the zero-sum constraint.</span>
<span class="cs-line"> </span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># ε = Σ_&#123;k≠r&#125; ŷ_k ≈ 3e-9 (late training)</span>
