      <pre class="cs-pre">
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Zero-sum constraint and its violation</span>
<span class="cs-line"> </span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Exact arithmetic: gradient sum = 0</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Σ_k ∇_&#123;W_k&#125; L = Σ_k (ŷ_k - y_k) h</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt">#   = (Σ_k ŷ_k - Σ_k y_k) h</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt">#   = (1 - 1) h = 0</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># → W_G never changes (exact invariant)</span>
<span class="cs-line"> </span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Under SC: correct class gradient = 0</span>
<span class="cs-line hl-p">Σ_k ∇_&#123;W_k&#125; L → Σ_&#123;k≠r&#125; ŷ_k · h = ε · h</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Net drift on W_G per update step:</span>
<span class="cs-line hl-p">E[ΔW_G] = -(η · ε / K) · μ_G</span>
<span class="cs-line"> </span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Theorem 3.4: W_G drifts toward -μ_G</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># (direction of global feature mean)</span>
<span class="cs-line"> </span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Fix: enforce zero-sum projection</span>
<span class="cs-line hl-g"><span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">zero_sum_project</span>(logit_grads):</span>
